description: Swift UI and package conventions for RouteFinder
globs: RouteFinder/**/*.swift
alwaysApply: false
---

# Swift / UI

- Swift 5.9+ with strict concurrency; prefer structs; actors for shared mutable state; async/await for I/O.
- Public APIs need doc comments; follow Swift API Design Guidelines.
- All UI: `GlassmorphicModifiers` (`glassPanel`, `controlSheetStyle`, …).
- UITEST launch args live in `UITestLaunchConfigurator` / `RouteViewModel` seed helpers — extend those rather than ad-hoc UserDefaults.
- Fleet toast / SSE: `FleetDispatchCoordinator`; do not log Bearer tokens.
